ARM GAS  C:\msys64\tmp\cc9NRbLb.s 			page 646


  41:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/dac.h ****      ** Polling mode uses the blocking mode to transmit a single value at a time.
  42:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/dac.h ****      **
  43:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/dac.h ****      ** DMA mode uses a buffer, and periodically transmits it triggering a 
